    [
     {
      "type": "textmedia",
      "header": "",
      "body": "<p>The automatic documentation of individual tools and batches ensures complete traceability. Audible and visual alerts provide early notification of faults and maintenance needs. Thanks to the system’s service-friendly design, as well as remote access for software updates and remote maintenance, system availability remains consistently high. Optionally, a maintenance contract supports preventive servicing.</p>",
      "images": [],
      "videos": [],
